# Spec workflow

Before implementing features in this repository:

1. Read [doc/spec/README.md](doc/spec/README.md) and the target spec file.
2. Only implement specs with `status: approved`. Skip `draft` unless the user
   explicitly approves implementation. Do not rework `implemented` specs unless
   the user requests a change.

When implementation is complete and the spec's `## Acceptance` criteria pass:

1. Set the spec frontmatter `status: implemented` and fill `implements:` with
   code paths (e.g. `src-tauri/src/engine/`).
2. Update the Status and Implements columns for that spec in
   [doc/spec/README.md](doc/spec/README.md).

Never mark `implemented` if acceptance criteria fail or tests do not pass.
